  "canon:pmid": "20633755",
  "canon:title": "Suxamethonium induced prolonged apnea in a patient receiving electroconvulsive therapy.",
  "canon:abstract": "Suxamethonium causes prolonged apnea in patients in whom pseudocholinesterase enzyme gets deactivated by organophosphorus (OP) poisons. Here, we present a similar incident in a severely depressed patient who received electroconvulsive therapy (ECT). Prolonged apnea in our case ensued because the information about suicidal attempt by OP compound was concealed from the treating team.",
  "canon:text": "Suxamethonium induced prolonged apnea in a patient receiving electroconvulsive therapy. Suxamethonium causes prolonged apnea in patients in whom pseudocholinesterase enzyme gets deactivated by organophosphorus (OP) poisons. Here, we present a similar incident in a severely depressed patient who received electroconvulsive therapy (ECT). Prolonged apnea in our case ensued because the information about suicidal attempt by OP compound was concealed from the treating team.",
